Space science should feel that way, too.

3
00:00:07,788 --> 00:00:09,020
Meet Touch the Sky!

4
00:00:10,286 --> 00:00:12,550
Middle schoolers discover SPHEREx,

5
00:00:12,650 --> 00:00:14,150
